<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Focus</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: Conjurer (guild level 12)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast focus &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast focus</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>The caster touches the target and utters the word 'Mentati', and the 
target's mind comes into focus: their magic and their charisma both rise, 
by up to 10 each, for about ten minutes. The better the casting, the 
bigger the rise. Casting it on someone who is already focused does 
nothing.
</p><p>You must be standing to cast it, and no free hands are needed.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Charisma</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>